------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Presentations of groups
--
-- More stored matrices of local circuits, as literals
--
-- As GeneralN.Locals, for the singly controlled ZX and XZ on the wires
-- 0 1, read on three wires.  Each literal is the reading of the word
-- as its clients spell it, decided by one boolean on the row-operation
-- reading (Evaluation.by-rows).  Proving it for a respelling at width 3
-- and transporting along the equation of the two words, as this module
-- once did, cost a minute each: the conversion checker compared the two
-- stored readings by evaluating dense products.
------------------------------------------------------------------------

